sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Interlock controller
    participant A as Leg A: Q1/Q2
    participant B as Leg B: Q3/Q4
    Note over C,B: Reset or fault: all four gates OFF
    C->>A: Q1 ON, Q2 OFF
    C->>B: Q3 OFF, Q4 ON
    Note over A,B: Positive bridge polarity
    C->>A: Q1 OFF; Q2 remains OFF
    C->>B: Q4 OFF; Q3 remains OFF
    Note over A,B: Dead time; no commanded MOSFET conduction
    C->>A: Q1 OFF, Q2 ON
    C->>B: Q3 ON, Q4 OFF
    Note over A,B: Negative bridge polarity
    C->>A: Q2 OFF; Q1 remains OFF
    C->>B: Q3 OFF; Q4 remains OFF
    Note over A,B: Dead time before next positive state
